{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A kind hand may lead to the end....</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Gamble your way out of Eclipse Casino, a challenging roguelike turn-based rpg where you must escape the <i>Shady</i> Casino Owner by fighting and gambling your way out!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fight 3 bosses (Poker Star, Chef, &amp; Sports Fans)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Learn 40+ skills (Tier 1\u00a0 &amp; Tier 2)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Meeting </strong><strong><i>or recruiting</i></strong><strong> over 20 different characters! </strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Countless Unique Bosses</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619010/extras/DC3x3.gif?t=1743433832\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619010/extras/SF3x3.gif?t=1743433832\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Endless Skill Combos</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With over 50 skills to learn and forget, not only is each playthrough different, but each fight as well! Almost all skills have a usage amount to them, adding an additional level to skill management. Gain skills from playing the casino games as well as through other means.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619010/extras/MoneyFinal.png?t=1743433832\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619010/extras/SlotFinal.png?t=1743433832\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3619010/extras/PopFinal.png?t=1743433832\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" 